1
00:00:00,637 --> 00:00:02,047
(Arthur:)Sheldon, what are you doing here?

2
00:00:02,205 --> 00:00:04,815
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry. Did I wake you?

3
00:00:04,975 --> 00:00:07,285
(Arthur:)Of course you woke me.
It's 7:30.

4
00:00:09,946 --> 00:00:12,826
(Sheldon:)Well, I would have been here sooner,
but for some reason your home

5
00:00:12,983 --> 00:00:15,723
(Sheldon:)isn't on this map of Hollywood stars.

6
00:00:16,553 --> 00:00:18,293
(Arthur:)What do you want, Sheldon?

7
00:00:19,389 --> 00:00:21,369
(Sheldon:)It's been pointed out
by my girlfriend

8
00:00:21,524 --> 00:00:24,364
(Sheldon:)that I may have been annoying to you.

9
00:00:24,494 --> 00:00:26,474
(Arthur:)She sounds like a keeper.

10
00:00:27,731 --> 00:00:31,841
(Sheldon:)Anyway, I wanted to apologize.
I am truly sorry.

11
00:00:31,968 --> 00:00:33,918
(Arthur:)All right, apology accepted.
Have a nice night.

12
00:00:34,070 --> 00:00:36,740
(Sheldon:)Now that we've cleared the air,

13
00:00:36,906 --> 00:00:39,216
(Sheldon:)I wanted to discuss
another matter with you.

14
00:00:39,376 --> 00:00:42,156
(Arthur:)Sheldon, in a couple hours,
I have to get up,

15
00:00:42,312 --> 00:00:44,762
(Arthur:)pee and then wander
around the house.

16
00:00:51,655 --> 00:00:53,935
(Sheldon:)Well, then, I'll make this quick.

17
00:00:54,090 --> 00:00:56,730
(Sheldon:)I want to talk about the paper
you sent Leonard.

